n10: $ … ⇒ ∀ k ∀ j (k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ d4_tnl → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ d4_tnl) $ by all_intro [all_intro [n9]]
