a1: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ d4_tnr , y = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_teqv y c ∈ lrel2 , ra_nth_ty c i f e ∈ lrel ⇒ crn j ⊆ d4_tnr $ by ax
a2: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ d4_tnr , y = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_teqv y c ∈ lrel2 , ra_nth_ty c i f e ∈ lrel ⇒ y = ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by ax
a3: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ d4_tnr , y = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_teqv y c ∈ lrel2 , ra_nth_ty c i f e ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_teqv y c ∈ lrel2 $ by ax
a4: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ d4_tnr , y = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_teqv y c ∈ lrel2 , ra_nth_ty c i f e ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_nth_ty c i f e ∈ lrel $ by ax
