ahS: $ G , y = ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ c = ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ , y = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons a (scons d ∅) ⟩ ∧ i = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ f = a ⇒ y = ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ $ by weaken [aS]
