atS: $ G , y = ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ c = ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ , c = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons g (scons d ∅) ⟩ ∧ i = ⟨ kc_s , scons n ∅ ⟩ ∧ f = a ∧ ra_nth_ctor d n a ∈ lrel ⇒ c = ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ $ by weaken [aS]
at1: $ G , y = ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ c = ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ , c = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons g (scons d ∅) ⟩ ∧ i = ⟨ kc_s , scons n ∅ ⟩ ∧ f = a ∧ ra_nth_ctor d n a ∈ lrel ⇒ kc_cnil ∈ ω $ by kc_cnil_omega
at2: $ G , y = ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ c = ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ , c = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons g (scons d ∅) ⟩ ∧ i = ⟨ kc_s , scons n ∅ ⟩ ∧ f = a ∧ ra_nth_ctor d n a ∈ lrel ⇒ kc_ccons ∈ ω $ by kc_ccons_omega
at3: $ … ⇒ ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons g (scons d ∅) ⟩ $ by eq_trans [eq_sym [atS], and_elim_l [at0]]
at4: $ … ⇒ kc_cnil = kc_ccons $ by opair_inj_l_c [at3, wcel_isset [at1], wcel_isset [at2]]
at5: $ G , y = ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ c = ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ , c = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons g (scons d ∅) ⟩ ∧ i = ⟨ kc_s , scons n ∅ ⟩ ∧ f = a ∧ ra_nth_ctor d n a ∈ lrel ⇒ ¬ kc_cnil = kc_ccons $ by kc_cnil_ne_ccons
at6: $ … ⇒ ∃ p (ra_nth_ctor y i p ∈ lrel ∧ ra_eeqv p f ∈ lrel2) $ by bot_elim [not_elim [at5, at4]]
