bv2: $ G , y = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ ∧ c = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons x2 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_eeqv x1 x2 ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_cseqv x5 x6 ∈ lrel2 ⇒ y = ⟨ k1 , j1 ⟩ $ by weaken [#2]
