k1Pc5: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_bvar , scons i ∅ ⟩ ∧ t = ⟨ kc_bvar , scons i ∅ ⟩ , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons u (scons w ∅) ⟩ ∧ b = ⟨ kc_s , scons r ∅ ⟩ ∧ d = y ∧ ra_isort w r y ∈ lrel ⇒ ¬ kc_bvar = kc_pi $ by kc_bvar_ne_pi
k1Pc6: $ … ⇒ ∃ x (ra_isort t b x ∈ lrel ∧ lveq d x) $ by bot_elim [not_elim [k1Pc5, k1Pc4]]
