bp3: $ … ⇒ ra_eeqv x1 x2 ∈ lrel2 $ by and_elim_l [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [b0]]]
bp4: $ … ⇒ ra_cseqv x3 x4 ∈ lrel2 $ by and_elim_l [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [b0]]]]
