bs: $ … ⇒ (c = ⟨ kc_tnil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ n = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ m = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩) ∨ ∃ a ∃ b ∃ d ∃ r ∃ v ∃ o ∃ q (c = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons a (scons b (scons d ∅)) ⟩ ∧ n = ⟨ kc_s , scons r ∅ ⟩ ∧ m = q ∧ ra_ntys d r v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen_c b o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add v o q ∈ lrel) $ by lrel_ntys_cases [bv4]
