n4: $ G , z ∊ ient e w Z J , ⟨ J , ⟨ x1 , x2 ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z ∧ ((iprop e J w ∧ z = nest x1 ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop e J w ∧ z = nest x1 x2)) , ¬ iprop e J w ∧ z = nest x1 x2 , iprop d J w ⇒ ra_teqv t v ∈ lrel2 $ by weaken [#3]
