lemma d4_ifam_l (G: hyps) (M: class) (u d e p q t v w: set): $ G ⇒ iprt d p t $ > $ G ⇒ iprt e q v $ > $ G ⇒ ra_ceqv p q ∈ lrel2 $ > $ G ⇒ ra_teqv t v ∈ lrel2 $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ tsub' d ⊆ einv u M w $ > $ G ⇒ d ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ ifam u (dnf u M) d w ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) e w $
----
c1: $ G , x ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) d w , x ∊ u , x ⊆ {y | y ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) e w} , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) d w x , c ∊ x ⇒ c ∊ x $ by ax
c0: $ G , x ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) d w , x ∊ u , x ⊆ {y | y ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) e w} , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) d w x , c ∊ x ⇒ x ⊆ {y | y ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) e w} $ by ax
c3: $ … ⇒ c ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) e w $ by cab_elim [subset_elim [c0, c1]]
z1: $ … ⇒ x ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) e w $ by subset_intro [c3]
zw1: $ G , x ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) d w , x ∊ u , x ⊆ {y | y ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) e w} , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) d w x ⇒ iprt d p t $ by weaken [#1]
zw2: $ G , x ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) d w , x ∊ u , x ⊆ {y | y ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) e w} , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) d w x ⇒ iprt e q v $ by weaken [#2]
zw3: $ G , x ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) d w , x ∊ u , x ⊆ {y | y ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) e w} , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) d w x ⇒ ra_ceqv p q ∈ lrel2 $ by weaken [#3]
zw4: $ G , x ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) d w , x ∊ u , x ⊆ {y | y ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) e w} , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) d w x ⇒ ra_teqv t v ∈ lrel2 $ by weaken [#4]
zw5: $ G , x ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) d w , x ∊ u , x ⊆ {y | y ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) e w} , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) d w x ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#5]
zw6: $ G , x ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) d w , x ∊ u , x ⊆ {y | y ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) e w} , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) d w x ⇒ tsub' d ⊆ einv u M w $ by weaken [#6]
zw7: $ G , x ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) d w , x ∊ u , x ⊆ {y | y ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) e w} , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) d w x ⇒ d ∊ trees ω $ by weaken [#7]
z2: $ … ⇒ ixs d w x = ixs e w x $ by ixs_eqv [zw1, zw2, zw4, zw5]
z3: $ … ⇒ iop0 u (dnf u M) d w x ⊆ iop0 u (dnf u M) e w x $ by d4_iop0_l [zw1, zw2, zw3, zw4, zw5, zw6, zw7, z2]
z4: $ G , x ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) d w , x ∊ u , x ⊆ {y | y ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) e w} , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) d w x ⇒ z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) d w x $ by ax
z5: $ G , x ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) d w , x ∊ u , x ⊆ {y | y ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) e w} , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) d w x ⇒ x ∊ u $ by ax
z6: $ … ⇒ z ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) e w $ by ifam_intro [z1, z5, subset_elim [z3, z4]]
z7: $ … ⇒ z ∊ {y | y ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) e w} $ by cab_intro [z6]
k1: $ … ⇒ iop0 u (dnf u M) d w x ⊆ {y | y ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) e w} $ by subset_intro [z7]
k2: $ … ⇒ ∀ x (x ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) d w → x ∊ u → x ⊆ {y | y ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) e w} → iop0 u (dnf u M) d w x ⊆ {y | y ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) e w}) $ by all_intro [imp_intro [imp_intro [imp_intro [k1]]]]
k3: $ … ⇒ ifam u (dnf u M) d w ⊆ {y | y ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) e w} $ by ifam_ind [k2]
k4: $ G , c ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) d w ⇒ c ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) d w $ by ax
k5: $ G , c ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) d w ⇒ ifam u (dnf u M) d w ⊆ {y | y ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) e w} $ by weaken [k3]
k6: $ … ⇒ c ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) e w $ by cab_elim [subset_elim [k5, k4]]
fin: $ … ⇒ ifam u (dnf u M) d w ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) e w $ by subset_intro [k6]

