zw5: $ G , x ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) e w , x ∊ u , x ⊆ {y | y ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) d w} , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) e w x ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#5]
zw6: $ G , x ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) e w , x ∊ u , x ⊆ {y | y ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) d w} , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) e w x ⇒ tsub' d ⊆ einv u M w $ by weaken [#6]
zw7: $ G , x ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) e w , x ∊ u , x ⊆ {y | y ∊ ifam u (dnf u M) d w} , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) e w x ⇒ d ∊ trees ω $ by weaken [#7]
