ifam_eqv
----
l1: $ … ⇒ ifam u (dnf u M) d w = ifam u (dnf u M) e w $ by subset_antisym [d4_ifam_l [#1, #2, #3, #4, #5, #6, #7], d4_ifam_r [#1, #2, #3, #4, #5, #6, #7]]

lemma d4_itc_l (G: hyps) (M: class) (u d e p q t v w: set): $ G ⇒ iprt d p t $ > $ G ⇒ iprt e q v $ > $ G ⇒ ra_ceqv p q ∈ lrel2 $ > $ G ⇒ ra_teqv t v ∈ lrel2 $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ tsub' d ⊆ einv u M w $ > $ G ⇒ d ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ itc u (dnf u M) d w ⊆ itc u (dnf u M) e w $
----
s0: $ G , z ∊ itc u (dnf u M) d w ⇒ z ∊ itc u (dnf u M) d w $ by ax
s1: $ … ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 (iprt d x2 x3 ∧ ityf d x1 x4 ∧ x5 ∊ esat u (dnf u M) x2 w ∧ ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x4 w x5 ∧ z = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x6 ++ x5 , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by cab_elim [s0]
k0: $ G , z ∊ itc u (dnf u M) d w , iprt d x2 x3 ∧ ityf d x1 x4 ∧ x5 ∊ esat u (dnf u M) x2 w ∧ ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x4 w x5 ∧ z = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x6 ++ x5 , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ iprt d x2 x3 ∧ ityf d x1 x4 ∧ x5 ∊ esat u (dnf u M) x2 w ∧ ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x4 w x5 ∧ z = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x6 ++ x5 , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
k1: $ … ⇒ iprt d x2 x3 $ by and_elim_l [k0]
k2: $ … ⇒ ityf d x1 x4 $ by and_elim_l [and_elim_r [k0]]
k3: $ … ⇒ x5 ∊ esat u (dnf u M) x2 w $ by and_elim_l [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [k0]]]
k4: $ … ⇒ ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x4 w x5 $ by and_elim_l [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [k0]]]]
k5: $ … ⇒ z = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x6 ++ x5 , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [and_elim_r [k0]]]]
w1: $ G , z ∊ itc u (dnf u M) d w , iprt d x2 x3 ∧ ityf d x1 x4 ∧ x5 ∊ esat u (dnf u M) x2 w ∧ ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , ⟨ x8 , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x4 w x5 ∧ z = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x6 ++ x5 , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ iprt d p t $ by weaken [#1]
