lemma d4_ictor_l (G: hyps) (M J C: class) (u d e p q t v w: set): $ G ⇒ iprt d p t $ > $ G ⇒ iprt e q v $ > $ G ⇒ ra_ceqv p q ∈ lrel2 $ > $ G ⇒ ra_teqv t v ∈ lrel2 $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ tsub' d ⊆ einv u M w $ > $ G ⇒ d ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ ictor u (dnf u M) d J C w ⊆ ictor u (dnf u M) e J C w $
----
s0: $ G , z ∊ ictor u (dnf u M) d J C w ⇒ z ∊ ictor u (dnf u M) d J C w $ by ax
s1: $ … ⇒ ¬ iprop d J w ∧ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 (iprt d x2 x3 ∧ x1 ∊ esat u (dnf u M) x2 w ∧ ictk d J C x4 ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x4 w (x1 ++ ixs d w (ifam u (dnf u M) d w)) ∧ x9 ∊ scons C x6 ∧ z = nest (x5 ++ x1) x9) $ by cab_elim [s0]
s1l: $ … ⇒ ¬ iprop d J w $ by and_elim_l [s1]
s1r: $ … ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 (iprt d x2 x3 ∧ x1 ∊ esat u (dnf u M) x2 w ∧ ictk d J C x4 ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x4 w (x1 ++ ixs d w (ifam u (dnf u M) d w)) ∧ x9 ∊ scons C x6 ∧ z = nest (x5 ++ x1) x9) $ by and_elim_r [s1]
n0: $ G , z ∊ ictor u (dnf u M) d J C w , iprop e J w ⇒ iprop e J w $ by ax
n1: $ G , z ∊ ictor u (dnf u M) d J C w , iprop e J w ⇒ ¬ iprop d J w $ by weaken [s1l]
nw1: $ G , z ∊ ictor u (dnf u M) d J C w , iprop e J w ⇒ iprt d p t $ by weaken [#1]
nw2: $ G , z ∊ ictor u (dnf u M) d J C w , iprop e J w ⇒ iprt e q v $ by weaken [#2]
nw4: $ G , z ∊ ictor u (dnf u M) d J C w , iprop e J w ⇒ ra_teqv t v ∈ lrel2 $ by weaken [#4]
nw5: $ G , z ∊ ictor u (dnf u M) d J C w , iprop e J w ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#5]
n2: $ … ⇒ iprop d J w $ by d4_iprop_r [nw1, nw2, nw4, nw5, n0]
